%% PathMate.ai - Hiring Simulator sequence
%% Render: https://mermaid.live

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as POST personalized-hiring-simulator
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant OAI as OpenAI API

    User->>FE: Open /hiring-simulator page
    FE->>Auth: getSession optional Bearer

    FE->>API: POST /api/personalized-hiring-simulator
    API->>Auth: getUserIdFromRequest

    alt Anonymous or missing config
        API->>API: fallback null profile
        API-->>FE: profile_fallback scores
    else Authenticated user
        API->>DB: profiles.select
        API->>DB: cover_letters recent rows
        API->>API: fallback resumeMatch interviewQuestions

        alt OpenAI and profile available
            API->>OAI: responses.create gpt-4.1-mini
            OAI-->>API: Simulator bootstrap JSON
            API->>API: clamp scores and merge
            API-->>FE: source openai with questions
        else Fallback only
            API-->>FE: source profile_fallback
        end
    end

    FE->>FE: setData and render interview questions

    Note over User,FE: Answer feedback is not re-fetched on each keystroke

    loop Local practice loop
        User->>FE: Type interview answer
        FE->>FE: adjustedReadiness useMemo heuristic
        FE-->>User: Show scores from bootstrap payload
    end

    opt hiring-manager API exists but not called here
        FE->>API: Would POST /api/evaluate/hiring-manager
        API->>DB: Would save interview_sessions
    end

    FE-->>User: Show recommendedActions list
